@startuml
!include _style.iuml
title Information flow · result replay and version fencing · 76282d3
skinparam defaultFontSize 22
skinparam ArrowFontSize 21
skinparam NoteFontSize 19
skinparam titleFontSize 22
skinparam LegendFontSize 18
skinparam BackgroundColor #ffffff
hide footbox
participant "MediaResults" as results $MEDIA
database "MediaInbox\nmedia_db" as inbox $MEDIA
participant "media.projections\napply_result()" as projection $MEDIA
results -> inbox : 1  accept(): insert / compare\n(message_id, canonical body hash)
alt same message_id + same body
  inbox --> results : 2a  Duplicate: no projection mutation
else same message_id + different body
  inbox --> results : 2b  MessageConflict: rollback / batch failure
else new message_id
  results -> projection : 2c  apply_result(session, body)
  note over projection
    Identity / job / source checks precede version checks.
    Example: live Asset, valid result, stored state_version = 3:
    incoming v2: ignore stale state
    v3, identical semantic content: ignore replay
    v3, DIFFERENT content: reject conflict
    v4: apply only if attempt / transition fences pass
    Semantic content excludes message_id.
  end note
end
note over results,projection
  Inbox + projection share ONE transaction; conflict rolls back both.
end note
legend bottom
  Blue = Media-owned. Solid = call; dashed = return. Snapshot projection, not event sourcing.
endlegend
@enduml
